        "TileImage": "$($repository f98f3bfd-6449-465f-80f7-ed15ed04c942).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rGelateria Bella has cornered the Sapienza market through a campaign of ruthless sabotage. Our client, Lorenzo Vitale, requires the removal of five key employees serving as the shop’s muscle. \r\rAny method is permitted, but the client insists on absolute discretion. Make sure you erase all security footage before extraction. Eliminating these individuals will effectively bring their illicit operations to a halt. \r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
